---
title: Teleop State Machine
config:
    theme: forest
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Initializing: Launch Teleop Node
    
    Initializing --> Idle: Publishers/Subscribers Ready
    
    Idle --> Accelerating: Press ↑
    Idle --> Decelerating: Press ↓
    Idle --> Stopping: Press 0
    Idle --> Shutdown: Press ESC
    
    Accelerating --> CruisingForward: Velocity >= 1.0 m/s
    Accelerating --> Idle: Press 0
    Accelerating --> Decelerating: Press ↓
    Accelerating --> Shutdown: Press ESC
    
    CruisingForward --> Decelerating: Press ↓
    CruisingForward --> Stopping: Press 0
    CruisingForward --> Shutdown: Press ESC
    
    Decelerating --> CruisingReverse: Velocity <= -1.0 m/s
    Decelerating --> Idle: Press 0
    Decelerating --> Accelerating: Press ↑
    Decelerating --> Shutdown: Press ESC
    
    CruisingReverse --> Accelerating: Press ↑
    CruisingReverse --> Stopping: Press 0
    CruisingReverse --> Shutdown: Press ESC
    
    Stopping --> Idle: Velocity = 0
    Stopping --> Shutdown: Press ESC
    
    Shutdown --> SafeStop: Send zero velocity
    SafeStop --> DisableMotor: Call motor disable service
    DisableMotor --> [*]: Node exits
    
    note right of Initializing
        - Load parameters
        - Create /cmd_vel publisher
        - Setup key input handler
    end note
    
    note right of Accelerating
        Published cmd_vel:
        linear.x += accel_step
        clamped to [current, 1.0]
    end note
    
    note right of Decelerating
        Published cmd_vel:
        linear.x -= accel_step
        clamped to [-1.0, current]
    end note
    
    note right of Stopping
        Published cmd_vel:
        linear.x = 0.0
        Smooth ramp to zero
    end note
    
    note right of SafeStop
        1. Publish cmd_vel = 0
        2. Wait for feedback confirmation
        3. Call /motors/motor_1/disable
    end note
